<body>
<!-- GTM/Meta noscript beacons removed: they fire unconditionally and cannot
     be consent-gated (PECR). JS-off visitors are simply not tracked. -->

<!-- Crawler / no-JS fallback: real content for search engines, AI assistants, and users without JS. -->
<noscript>
    <main>
        <h1>ISEKAI ZERO — AI Roleplay &amp; AI Story | Live Your Adventure</h1>
        <p>
            ISEKAI ZERO is an interactive AI storytelling app where you chat with AI characters that
            remember your choices, play branching storylines across fantasy, sci-fi, romance, and
            social-simulation scenarios, and build your own worlds. Creators earn a 25% profit share
            on text generation from content they publish. Free on iOS, Android, and web.
        </p>

        <h2>Live the story — don't just watch it</h2>
        <ul>
            <li><strong>AI characters with persistent memory</strong> — they remember past choices and evolve over time.</li>
            <li><strong>Branching storylines</strong> where your decisions materially shape outcomes.</li>
            <li><strong>Worldbuilding tools</strong> that turn written prompts into explorable narrative dimensions.</li>
            <li><strong>Creator profit share</strong> — 25% of text generation profit goes to the creator.</li>
            <li><strong>Available in 17 languages</strong> including English, Japanese, Korean, Chinese, Spanish, Portuguese, and more.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>Explore</h2>
        <ul>
            <li><a href="https://www.isekaizero.ai/explore">Explore and search characters and storylines</a></li>
            <li><a href="https://www.isekaizero.ai/creation">Creation studio — build your own</a></li>
            <li><a href="https://www.isekaizero.ai/aboutUs">About ISEKAI ZERO</a></li>
            <li><a href="https://www.isekaizero.ai/help">Help &amp; FAQ</a></li>
        </ul>

        <h2>Get the app</h2>
        <ul>
            <li><a href="https://apps.apple.com/us/app/isekai-zero/id6748359707">Download on the iOS App Store</a></li>
            <li><a href="https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.isekai.world">Download on Google Play</a></li>
        </ul>

        <h2>Frequently asked questions</h2>

        <h3>What is ISEKAI ZERO?</h3>
        <p>
            An interactive AI storytelling app where users chat with AI characters that remember
            choices and evolve personalities, play branching storylines, and build their own worlds.
            Creators earn 25% profit share on text generation.
        </p>

        <h3>Is ISEKAI ZERO free?</h3>
        <p>
            Yes. Free to download on iOS and Android. Text generation uses Mana, the in-app currency,
            which can be earned free or purchased.
        </p>

        <h3>What makes ISEKAI ZERO different from other AI chat apps?</h3>
        <p>
            Persistent character memory across sessions, worldbuilding tools that go beyond single
            characters, and a creator profit-share model (25% of text generation profit).
        </p>

        <h3>Who makes ISEKAI ZERO?</h3>
        <p>ARX Media Sdn Bhd, based in Kuching, Sarawak, Malaysia.</p>

        <h3>How do creators earn money?</h3>
        <p>
            Creators receive 25% of the Mana spent on text generation inside their characters and
            storylines, paid out via creator payout accounts.
        </p>

        <h3>What platforms is it available on?</h3>
        <p>iOS, Android, and the web at <a href="https://www.isekaizero.ai/">isekaizero.ai</a>.</p>

        <h3>Does it support languages other than English?</h3>
        <p>
            Yes — 17 languages: English, Japanese, Korean, Simplified and Traditional Chinese, Spanish,
            Portuguese (incl. Brazilian), French, German, Italian, Russian, Turkish, Arabic, Thai, Indonesian, and Malay.
        </p>

        <h3>Can AI characters remember previous conversations?</h3>
        <p>
            Yes. Characters have persistent memory and recall past choices across sessions, evolving
            their relationships with you over time.
        </p>

        <p><a href="https://www.isekaizero.ai/llms.txt">llms.txt</a> &middot; <a href="https://www.isekaizero.ai/sitemap.xml">sitemap.xml</a></p>
    </main>
</noscript>

